And what this is gonna do is ensure the fact that wherever the system is along its trajectory, there's always a safe path for the system to return to the safe set while avoiding the unsafe set along the way.

58
00:08:33,360 --> 00:08:45,440
And thus, when applied control inputs are chosen at each time step using this formulation, we can guarantee the safety of the system and also guarantee that the applied input evaluates the desired input whenever possible.

